    <projectUrl>https://github.com/Alaeddinalhamoud/Umbraco.MediaInventory.Report</projectUrl>
    <description>Adds a Media-section dashboard for auditing Umbraco media assets, including usage references, storage insights, CSV export, background refresh, and safe recycle-bin cleanup.</description>
    <releaseNotes>Initial release. Adds a Media Inventory dashboard for Umbraco 17 with searchable and filterable media reporting, tracked-reference details, storage and usage summaries, CSV export, background refresh, and recycle-bin cleanup for unused assets.</releaseNotes>
    <copyright>Copyright © 2026 Alaeddin Alhamoud</copyright>
    <tags>umbraco umbraco17 backoffice editor</tags>
